    "title": "pandas.DatetimeIndex.month_name — pandas 1.5.3 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.DatetimeIndex.month_name#\n\n- \nDatetimeIndex.month_name(**args* ,***kwargs* )[source]#\n- Return the month names with specified locale. \n  - Parameters\n    - **locale** str, optional\n    - Locale determining the language in which to return the month name. Default is English locale.\n  - Returns\n    - Series or Index\n    - Series or Index of month names.\n Examples >>> s = pd.Series(pd.date_range(start='2018-01', freq='M', periods=3)) >>> s 0 2018-01-31 1 2018-02-28 2 2018-03-31 dtype: datetime64[ns] >>> s.dt.month_name() 0 January 1 February 2 March dtype: object >>> idx = pd.date_range(start='2018-01', freq='M', periods=3) >>> idx DatetimeIndex(['2018-01-31', '2018-02-28', '2018-03-31'], dtype='datetime64[ns]', freq='M') >>> idx.month_name() Index(['January', 'February', 'March'], dtype='object')",
    "markdown_length": 813,
